# Kept self-contained because Ghostty theme files may not use `theme` or `config-file`.
#
# Deviations from the shipped theme (these used to be `palette` overrides in the
# main config, which would have applied to dark mode too):
#   7  base2 #eee8d5 instead of the muddy #bbb5a2 — tmux uses this as the inactive pane bg
#   10 real green instead of base01 gray
#   12 real blue  instead of base0 gray
